Zeta Pokémon are a unique gimmick to Pokémon Inritum.

Zeta Pokémon are identical to their counterparts but they posses higher stats than usual, the plot of Inritum revolves around finding out what Zeta Pokémon really are and what's causing it.

Prof. George is the lead scientist around this studies and the Protagonist will join his team to help unravel their secrets!

Below you can find a list of all the Zeta Pokémon in the game so far and if they are obtainable or not.

* Nymble
* Clauncher
* Zangoose
* Toxel
* Ribombee
* Hessian Metang
* Durant
* Kleavor
